<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθ-ίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set against,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.115
			</span></i>; esp. in battle, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελταστικὴν τῆ τοῦ παγκρατίου μάχῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					834a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τροπαῖον</span>
			<i>set up</i> a trophy <i>in opposition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.54
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				105
			</span></i>; <i>weigh against,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1389
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινὸς τὴν ὁλκήν</span>
			<i>outweigh</i> him, LX<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Si.</u>
				8.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>match with, compare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιστῆσαι καὶ παραβαλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Thes.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> uses only 
				Pass.
			, with intr. aor. 2
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντέστην.</span>
			aor. 1
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντεστάθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.72
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθέστηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
					9.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				Att.
			
			
				contr.
			
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθεστώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.70
				</span></i>
			: fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιστήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.75
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				645
			</span></i>:—<i>stand against,</i> esp. in battle,
				<i>withstand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἥρῃ δ᾽ ἀντέστη . . Ἄρτεμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.70
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.117
			</span></i> al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀνθισταμένους τοῖς ὑμετέροις
					βουλήμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.49
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν ἀνάγκην οὐδ᾽ Ἄρης ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					256
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				5.1
			</span></i>: rarely c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέος . . σοὶ φρενῶν ἀνθίσταται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					703
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθάπτεται</span> Wakef.), cf.
				<i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.520
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>turn out unfavourably</i> to one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιστάντος αὐτῷ τοῦ πράγματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄν τὰ παρ᾽ ὑμῶν τῶν ἀκουόντων
					ἀντιστῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.340
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs., <i>make
				a stand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ ἔτ᾽ ἄρ᾽ ἀνθίσταντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.305
				</span></i>
			; <i>resist, fight on,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.72
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1231
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				518
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
